---
name: Normalize a Kunai process event to OCSF
description: |
  Normalizes one Kunai `execve` event to OCSF Process Activity. The normalizer
  picks the OCSF class from the event name and maps the process, its parent, and
  its ancestors. Fields without an OCSF attribute remain under `unmapped`.
---

